#### Stores (Zustand)

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/stores/examStore.ts`
Zustand store untuk seluruh state ujian:
- `answers: (string | null)[]` — jawaban mahasiswa
- `currentQuestion: number` — soal yang sedang ditampilkan
- `timeRemaining: number` — detik tersisa (countdown)
- `examStatus: 'idle' | 'active' | 'paused' | 'submitted'`
- `questions: Question[]` — 33 soal yang sudah di-random
- Actions: `setAnswer()`, `tick()`, `submit()`, `startExam()`
- Middleware: `persist` ke localStorage (offline resilience)

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/stores/authStore.ts`
- `user: { name, npm/nip, role, deviceId }`
- `isAuthenticated: boolean`
- Actions: `login()`, `logout()`

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/stores/networkStore.ts`
- `isOnline: boolean`
- `pendingSubmissions: SubmitPayload[]` (retry queue)
- Auto-sync saat kembali online

