#### Hooks

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/hooks/useCountdown.ts`
- `setInterval` setiap 1 detik
- Panggil `examStore.tick()` setiap detik
- Trigger warning dialog saat < 5 menit
- Trigger auto-submit saat 0
- Handle visibility change (browser tab focus/blur)

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/hooks/useOnlineStatus.ts`
- Listen `window.addEventListener('online'/'offline')`
- Update `networkStore.isOnline`
- Trigger retry queue saat kembali online

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/hooks/useDeviceId.ts`
- Generate device fingerprint via FingerprintJS
- Simpan di localStorage
- Bandingkan dengan server saat login (Phase 2)

