#### Lib / Logic

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/lib/questions.ts`
- Parse 180 soal dari bank soal → format `Question[]`
- Function `randomizeQuestions(total: 33, distribution: {easy: 11, medium: 11, hard: 11})`
- Setiap `Question` punya: `id, text, options: string[], correctAnswer: string, level: 'easy'|'medium'|'hard', weight: number`

##### [NEW] `frontend/src/lib/grading.ts`
